 - **Strengths:** Reduces aliasing artifacts, improves rendering performance for distant views, and enables efficient traversal in acceleration structures [S4, unofficial].
-- **Limitations:** Requires additional memory for the mip-chain. The choice of filter (Average vs. Halton) affects visual quality and computational cost. Halton sampling may be more expensive per voxel than simple averaging [S2, unofficial].
